    "name": "Google Cloud Firestore Databases API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Cloud Firestore API provides RESTful access to Google Cloud Firestore, a flexible, scalable NoSQL cloud database for storing and syncing data. It enables CRUD operations on documents and collections, querying with filters and ordering, managing indexes, and handling real-time data synchronization across client apps.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Google Cloud",
